Matt 9:1 , Christ cures one sick of the palsy;
Matt 9:9 , calls Matthew from the receipt of custom;
Matt 9:10 , eats with publicans and sinners;
Matt 9:14 , defends his disciples for not fasting;
Matt 9:20 , cures the bloody issue;
Matt 9:23 , raises from death Jairus' daughter;
Matt 9:27 , gives sight to two blind men;
Matt 9:32 , heals a dumb man possessed of a devil;
Matt 9:36 , and has compassion on the multitude.
